  mainDialogue:
  - Hey, wake up!
  - "Don\u2019t fall too much behind, dummy. We still have a long way to walk, so\u2026
    no time to daydream, now."
  mainPlayerOptions:
  - "I\u2019m sorry."
  - "I don\u2019t daydream."
  mainAnswerA:
  - Sorry, I will try to keep up.
  - Just got distracted by some messages from home, they are worried sick about us
